        <title>On The Trail of The Lost Resource - My Investigation With Athena and CloudTrail</title>
        <link>https://antoinedelia.github.io/cloud-optimist/pr-116/en/posts/2025/on-the-trail-of-the-lost-resource-my-investigation-with-athena-and-cloudtrail/</link>
